Put these lines in `.env` and choose your own passwords 

```
SERVING_DB_ADMIN_PASSWORD=your-password-1
PIPELINE_WRITER_PASSWORD=your-password-2
ML_READER_PASSWORD=your-password-3
DASHBOARD_READER_PASSWORD=your-password-4
AIRFLOW_DB_PASSWORD=your-password-5
AIRFLOW_ADMIN_USER=admin
AIRFLOW_ADMIN_PASSWORD=your-password-6
AIRFLOW_SECRET_KEY=any-long-random-text
```
